          %p#NonRealizationOfMZZInNanowires
            Notably
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Majorana+anyons"} Majorana anyons
            (in the guise of “
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Majorana+zero+modes"}> Majorana zero modes
            ” in super/semi-conducting nanowires) are (or were until recently, see
            = succeed "," do
              %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/2106.11840v4"} arXiv:2106.11840v4
            = succeed ")" do
              %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/pdf/2106.11840v4.pdf#page=3"} p. 3
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/topological+quantum+computation"} topological quantum computation
            (following the plan laid out in
            = succeed ")." do
              %a{:href => "#DasSarmaFreedmanNayak15"} Das Sarma, Freedman &amp; Nayak 15
            %a{:href => "https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-021-00612-z"} in 2021
            \&amp;lbrack;
            %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1038/s41586-021-03373-x"}> doi:10.1038/s41586-021-03373-x
            ,
            = succeed "," do
              %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.4587841"} doi:10.5281/zenodo.4587841
            = succeed "," do
              %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.4545812"} doi:10.5281/zenodo.4545812
            = succeed "&rbrack;" do
              %a{:href => "https://www.delta.tudelft.nl/article/majorana-not-fraud-confirmation-bias#"} TU Delft press release
            %a{:href => "http://retractionwatch.com/2022/04/24/authors-retract-second-majorana-paper-from-nature/"} in 2022
            \&amp;lbrack;
            %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1038/s41586-022-04704-2"}> doi:10.1038/s41586-022-04704-2
            \&amp;rbrack; (further claims are under criticism, see e.g.
            = succeed "," do
              %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.6344447"} doi:10.5281/zenodo.6344447
            %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.6325378"} doi:10.5281/zenodo.6325378
            and the list
            = succeed ")" do
              %a{:href => "https://twitter.com/spinespresso/status/1503352928656138241"} here
            %a{:href => "#Nayak22"} Nayak 22
            \&amp;
            = succeed "," do
              %a{:href => "#MicrosoftQuantum22"} MicrosoftQuantum 22
            = succeed "," do
              %a{:href => "#FrolovMourik22a"} Frolov &amp; Mourik 22a
            %a{:href => "#FrolovMourik22a"} 22b
            and
            = succeed "." do
              %a{:href => "#Frolov22"} Frolov 22
          %p
            In any case, Majorana anyons are known not to be universal (not all
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/quantum+gates"} quantum gates
            may be approximated with Majorana braiding). The simplest universal
            = succeed "-anyon" do
